<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>PROJECT 83 — No perteneces aquí</title>
<meta name="description" content="Marca a puerta cerrada. Armadura para el 17% que sobrevive a los hierros, domina el costal y no acepta el dolor como excusa.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Anton&family=Big+Shoulders+Display:wght@500;700;800;900&family=Chakra+Petch:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --void:#08080A;
  --iron:#0F1015;
  --steel:#16181F;
  --ash:#2B2E36;
  --bone:#E9E7E2;
  --smoke:#83878F;
  --blood:#C8102E;
  --blood-hot:#FF2038;
  --notch:14px;
  --disp:'Big Shoulders Display','Anton','Arial Narrow',Impact,sans-serif;
  --util:'Chakra Petch','Segoe UI',system-ui,sans-serif;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{
  background:var(--void);color:var(--bone);
  font-family:var(--util);font-weight:400;
  -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  overflow-x:hidden;
}
body.locked{overflow:hidden;height:100vh}
img,svg{display:block}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
button,input{font:inherit;color:inherit}
::selection{background:var(--blood);color:#fff}
:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--blood-hot);outline-offset:3px}

/* ---------- textura ambiente ---------- */
.grit{
  position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:60;pointer-events:none;
  background:repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(255,255,255,.018) 0 1px,transparent 1px 3px);
  mix-blend-mode:overlay;
}

/* ---------- piezas base ---------- */
.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}
.notch{clip-path:polygon(var(--notch) 0,100% 0,100% calc(100% - var(--notch)),calc(100% - var(--notch)) 100%,0 100%,0 var(--notch))}
.rule{position:relative;height:2px;background:var(--ash)}
.rule::before{content:"";position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;width:17%;background:var(--blood)}
.eyebrow{
  font-family:var(--util);font-weight:600;font-size:.7rem;
  letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--smoke);
}
.eyebrow b{color:var(--blood-hot);font-weight:700}
h1,h2,h3,.disp{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:900;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:.86;letter-spacing:-.01em}
h2{font-size:clamp(2.4rem,6.2vw,4.6rem);margin:18px 0 0}
h3{font-size:clamp(1.5rem,2.5vw,2rem);line-height:.9}
p{color:var(--smoke);line-height:1.62;font-size:1rem}
p strong{color:var(--bone);font-weight:600}
.lede{font-size:clamp(1rem,1.5vw,1.15rem);max-width:60ch}
.sec{padding:clamp(80px,10vw,148px) 0;scroll-margin-top:70px}
.sec-head{max-width:64ch;margin-bottom:clamp(44px,6vw,72px)}
.sec-head .rule{margin-bottom:22px}

/* ---------- emblema ---------- */
.mark{width:100%;height:auto;color:var(--bone)}

/* ---------- PUERTA ---------- */
.gate{
  position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:50;background:var(--void);
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;
  overflow:hidden;transition:opacity .6s ease,transform .6s ease;
}
.gate--gone{opacity:0;transform:scale(1.04);pointer-events:none}
.gate-glow{
  position:absolute;top:-30%;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);
  width:120vw;height:80vh;pointer-events:none;
  background:radial-gradient(ellipse at center,rgba(200,16,46,.16),transparent 62%);
}
.gate-mark{
  position:absolute;left:50%;top:52%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);
  width:min(1000px,150vw);opacity:.05;pointer-events:none;
}
.gate .wrap{position:relative;z-index:2;width:100%}
.gate-top{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:clamp(30px,6vh,60px)}
.gate-top .mark{width:34px;flex:none}
.gate-top .rule{flex:1;height:1px}
.gate-h1{
  font-size:clamp(3.4rem,15vw,11.5rem);line-height:.8;
}
.gate-h1 span{display:block}
.gate-h1 .hollow{
  color:transparent;
  -webkit-text-stroke:clamp(1.6px,.32vw,3.4px) var(--blood);
  text-stroke:clamp(1.6px,.32vw,3.4px) var(--blood);
}
.gate-copy{margin:clamp(24px,4vh,38px) 0 clamp(30px,5vh,46px);max-width:56ch}
.gate-copy p{font-size:clamp(.95rem,1.4vw,1.1rem)}
.doors{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px}
.door{
  --notch:16px;
  position:relative;flex:1 1 260px;min-width:0;
  text-align:left;cursor:pointer;
  padding:20px 22px 18px;border:none;
  background:var(--steel);
  transition:background .18s ease,transform .18s ease;
}
.door .k{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2.1rem);line-height:.9;display:block;text-transform:uppercase}
.door .s{display:block;margin-top:8px;font-size:.72rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--smoke)}
.door--in{background:var(--blood);color:#fff}
.door--in .s{color:rgba(255,255,255,.72)}
.door--in:hover,.door--in:focus-visible{background:var(--blood-hot);transform:translateY(-2px)}
.door--out{background:transparent;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--ash);color:var(--smoke)}
.door--out:hover,.door--out:focus-visible{background:var(--iron);color:var(--bone)}
.gate-foot{margin-top:clamp(28px,5vh,44px);display:flex;gap:26px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.gate-foot span{font-size:.66rem;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5A5D66;font-weight:600}

/* ---------- BLOQUEO 83% ---------- */
.lock{
  position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:70;background:var(--void);
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;
  animation:slam .32s ease both;
}
.lock[hidden]{display:none}
@keyframes slam{from{opacity:0;transform:scale(1.12)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
.hazard{
  height:20px;
  background:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,var(--blood) 0 16px,var(--void) 16px 32px);
}
.lock-body{padding:clamp(40px,8vh,90px) 0}
.lock h2{font-size:clamp(3rem,11vw,8rem);margin:0}
.lock p{margin-top:22px;max-width:44ch;font-size:1.05rem}
.lie{
  margin-top:34px;display:inline-block;
  font-size:.72rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--smoke);border-bottom:1px solid var(--ash);padding-bottom:5px;cursor:pointer;
  background:none;border-top:none;border-left:none;border-right:none;
}
.lie:hover,.lie:focus-visible{color:var(--blood-hot);border-color:var(--blood-hot)}

/* ---------- NAV ---------- */
.nav{
  position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:40;
  background:rgba(8,8,10,.88);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(10px);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--ash);
  opacity:0;transform:translateY(-100%);transition:opacity .5s ease .25s,transform .5s ease .25s;
}
.nav.on{opacity:1;transform:none}
.nav-in{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:24px;height:62px}
.nav-mark{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
.nav-mark .mark{width:38px}
.nav-mark b{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:900;font-size:1.15rem;letter-spacing:.02em}
.nav-links{display:flex;gap:22px;margin-left:auto}
.nav-links a{font-size:.68rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--smoke);transition:color .15s}
.nav-links a:hover{color:var(--bone)}
.nav-chip{
  font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:900;font-size:1rem;
  background:var(--blood);color:#fff;padding:5px 10px 3px;letter-spacing:.02em;
}
@media(max-width:860px){.nav-links{display:none}.nav-chip{margin-left:auto}}

/* ---------- REVELADO ---------- */
.site,.foot{opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:opacity .6s ease .2s}
.site.on,.foot.on{opacity:1;visibility:visible}
.rev{opacity:0;transform:translateY(22px);transition:opacity .6s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.3,1),transform .6s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.3,1)}
.rev.in{opacity:1;transform:none}

/* ---------- DOCTRINA ---------- */
.filters{display:grid;gap:0;border-top:1px solid var(--ash)}
.filt{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1.1fr);
  gap:clamp(20px,4vw,56px);align-items:start;
  padding:clamp(28px,4vw,42px) 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ash);
}
.filt-key{font-size:.66rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--blood-hot);margin-bottom:12px}
.filt p{margin-top:12px;max-width:42ch;font-size:.95rem}
.gauge{margin-top:6px}
.gauge-nums{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:10px}
.gauge-nums .from{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:700;font-size:1.5rem;color:#4A4D55}
.gauge-nums .to{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(2.4rem,5vw,3.6rem);line-height:.8}
.gauge-track{height:10px;background:var(--steel);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.gauge-fill{position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;width:100%;background:#3A3D45;transition:width 1.1s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.25,1)}
.gauge.in .gauge-fill{width:var(--to)}
.filt--last .gauge-fill{background:var(--blood)}
.filt--last .gauge-nums .to{color:var(--blood-hot)}
.gauge-cap{margin-top:10px;font-size:.64rem;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5A5D66;font-weight:600}
.verdict{
  margin-top:clamp(40px,6vw,64px);
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(20px,4vw,44px);align-items:center;
}
.verdict .big{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(4rem,13vw,9rem);line-height:.76;color:var(--blood)}
.verdict p{font-size:clamp(1rem,1.6vw,1.2rem);max-width:38ch}
@media(max-width:760px){
  .filt{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .verdict{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px}
}

/* ---------- DROPS ---------- */
.drop-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:clamp(20px,3vw,32px)}
@media(max-width:880px){.drop-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.panel{background:var(--iron);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--ash);padding:clamp(24px,3.4vw,38px)}
.drop-tag{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:18px}
.drop-tag .dot{width:8px;height:8px;background:var(--blood);animation:pulse 1.6s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes pulse{0%,100%{opacity:1}50%{opacity:.25}}
.drop-tag span{font-size:.66rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase}
.drop-name{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(2.2rem,5vw,3.4rem);line-height:.86;text-transform:uppercase}
.specs{margin-top:26px;border-top:1px solid var(--ash)}
.spec{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;padding:13px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ash)}
.spec dt{font-size:.68rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--smoke)}
.spec dd{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:800;font-size:1.15rem;text-transform:uppercase;text-align:right}
.spec dd em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blood-hot)}
.stock{margin-top:26px}
.stock-track{height:14px;background:var(--steel);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.stock-fill{position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;width:0;background:var(--blood);transition:width 1.3s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.25,1)}
.stock.in .stock-fill{width:83%}
.stock-cap{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:9px;font-size:.64rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--smoke)}
.clock{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:8px;margin-top:8px}
.clock-cell{background:var(--steel);padding:16px 6px 12px;text-align:center}
.clock-cell b{display:block;font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4.4vw,2.7rem);line-height:.9;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.clock-cell span{display:block;margin-top:7px;font-size:.58rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--smoke)}
.no-restock{margin-top:26px;padding-top:22px;border-top:1px solid var(--ash)}
.no-restock p{font-size:.92rem}

/* ---------- ARSENAL ---------- */
.kit{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(258px,1fr));gap:1px;background:var(--ash);box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--ash)}
.kit-item{background:var(--void);padding:clamp(22px,2.6vw,30px);position:relative;transition:background .2s ease}
.kit-item:hover{background:var(--iron)}
.kit-item::after{
  content:"";position:absolute;top:0;right:0;
  border-top:12px solid var(--blood);border-left:12px solid transparent;
  opacity:0;transition:opacity .2s ease;
}
.kit-item:hover::after{opacity:1}
.kit-item h3{font-size:1.3rem;max-width:14ch}
.kit-item p{margin-top:11px;font-size:.88rem;max-width:32ch}
.kit-meta{margin-top:18px;font-size:.6rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5A5D66}
.kit-meta em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blood-hot)}

/* ---------- PROTOCOLO ---------- */
.paths{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:clamp(16px,2.4vw,26px)}
@media(max-width:800px){.paths{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.path{position:relative;background:var(--iron);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--ash);padding:clamp(26px,3.2vw,40px)}
.path-pct{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(3.4rem,8vw,5.6rem);line-height:.8;color:var(--blood)}
.path h3{margin-top:14px}
.path p{margin-top:14px;font-size:.94rem}
.path ul{margin-top:20px;list-style:none;border-top:1px solid var(--ash)}
.path li{padding:11px 0 11px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ash);position:relative;font-size:.86rem;color:var(--smoke)}
.path li::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:17px;width:7px;height:7px;background:var(--blood)}
.fine{margin-top:26px;font-size:.8rem;color:#5A5D66;max-width:70ch}

/* ---------- MARCAS OCULTAS ---------- */
.hidden-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 340px;gap:clamp(28px,5vw,64px);align-items:center}
@media(max-width:860px){.hidden-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.marks{list-style:none;margin-top:26px;border-top:1px solid var(--ash)}
.marks li{padding:16px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ash);display:grid;grid-template-columns:118px minmax(0,1fr);gap:18px;align-items:baseline}
.marks b{font-size:.64rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--blood-hot)}
.marks span{font-size:.92rem;color:var(--smoke);line-height:1.55}
.tag-stage{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:16px}
.tag{width:210px;height:250px;perspective:900px;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;padding:0}
.tag-in{position:relative;width:100%;height:100%;-webkit-transform-style:preserve-3d;transform-style:preserve-3d;transition:transform .55s cubic-bezier(.3,.8,.3,1)}
.tag:hover .tag-in,.tag:focus-visible .tag-in,.tag.flip .tag-in{transform:rotateY(180deg)}
.tag-face{
  position:absolute;inset:0;-webkit-backface-visibility:hidden;backface-visibility:hidden;
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;
  box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--ash);
}
.tag-front{background:var(--bone);color:var(--void)}
.tag-front small{font-size:.6rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6A6A6A}
.tag-front b{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:900;font-size:4.4rem;line-height:.8}
.tag-front i{font-style:normal;font-size:.56rem;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8A8A8A;margin-top:10px}
.tag-back{background:var(--void);color:var(--bone);transform:rotateY(180deg);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--blood)}
.tag-back b{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:900;font-size:4rem;line-height:.8;color:var(--blood-hot)}
.tag-back small{font-size:.58rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--smoke);text-align:center;max-width:24ch;line-height:1.8}
.tag-hint{font-size:.62rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5A5D66}

/* ---------- LISTA ---------- */
.list-sec{border-top:1px solid var(--ash);background:var(--iron)}
.list-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:clamp(28px,5vw,70px);align-items:center}
@media(max-width:860px){.list-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.form-row{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:26px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.field{
  flex:1 1 220px;min-width:0;background:var(--void);
  box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--ash);
  padding:16px 16px;font-size:.95rem;border:none;
}
.field::placeholder{color:#4E5158}
.field:focus{box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--blood)}
.btn{
  --notch:12px;
  background:var(--blood);color:#fff;border:none;cursor:pointer;
  padding:16px 26px;font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:900;font-size:1.05rem;
  text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.03em;
  transition:background .18s ease,transform .18s ease;
}
.btn:hover,.btn:focus-visible{background:var(--blood-hot);transform:translateY(-2px)}
.form-msg{margin-top:14px;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.06em;min-height:1.2em}
.form-msg--err{color:var(--blood-hot)}
.form-msg--ok{color:var(--bone)}
.done{margin-top:26px}
.done b{display:block;font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,3rem);line-height:.9;text-transform:uppercase}
.done p{margin-top:12px;max-width:36ch}
.list-side{display:grid;gap:1px;background:var(--ash);box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--ash)}
.list-side div{background:var(--iron);padding:22px 24px}
.list-side b{display:block;font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:900;font-size:1.9rem;line-height:.9;color:var(--blood-hot)}
.list-side span{display:block;margin-top:8px;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--smoke);line-height:1.55}

/* ---------- FOOTER ---------- */
.foot{border-top:1px solid var(--ash);padding:clamp(50px,7vw,80px) 0 40px}
.foot-top{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:30px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.foot-mark{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px}
.foot-mark .mark{width:78px}
.foot-mark b{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,2.6rem);line-height:.85;display:block;text-transform:uppercase}
.foot-mark span{display:block;margin-top:6px;font-size:.62rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--smoke)}
.foot-say{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(1.4rem,3vw,2.2rem);text-transform:uppercase;line-height:.9;max-width:16ch;text-align:right}
.foot-say em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blood)}
@media(max-width:700px){.foot-say{text-align:left}}
.foot-bottom{margin-top:44px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--ash);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.foot-bottom span{font-size:.62rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#4E5158}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
  html{scroll-behavior:auto}
  *,*::before,*::after{animation-duration:.001ms!important;transition-duration:.001ms!important}
  .rev{opacity:1;transform:none}
}
</style>
</head>
<body class="locked">

<svg width="0" height="0" style="position:absolute" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
  <symbol id="p83" viewBox="0 0 200 124">
    <g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="7" stroke-linecap="butt" stroke-linejoin="miter">
      <path d="M10 106 A 92 92 0 0 1 72 24"/>
      <path d="M128 24 A 92 92 0 0 1 190 106"/>
      <path d="M38 106 L 76 46 L 87 60 L 100 6 L 116 56 L 127 42 L 162 106"/>
    </g>
    <path d="M99 38 L 76 80 L 89 80 L 79 106 L 106 68 L 92 68 Z" fill="var(--blood)"/>
    <path d="M8 113 H 192" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="11" stroke-linecap="butt"/>
  </symbol>
</svg>

<div class="grit" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<!-- ===================== PUERTA ===================== -->
<div class="gate" id="gate">
  <div class="gate-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <svg class="mark gate-mark" viewBox="0 0 200 124" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#p83"/></svg>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="gate-top">
      <svg class="mark" viewBox="0 0 200 124" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#p83"/></svg>
      <p class="eyebrow" style="flex:none">Project 83 · Acceso restringido</p>
      <div class="rule"></div>
    </div>

    <h1 class="gate-h1">
      <span>No perteneces</span>
      <span class="hollow">Aquí</span>
    </h1>

    <div class="gate-copy">
      <p>Project 83 es una marca a puerta cerrada. Solo fabricamos armadura para el <strong>17%</strong> que sobrevive a los hierros, domina el costal y no acepta el dolor como excusa.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:14px">El otro 83% ya cerró esta pestaña. Elige.</p>
    </div>

